  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kemikalieinspektionen projektf&#xf6;rberedande insats i Ukraina 2023-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Chemicals Agency: Ukraine project design support 2023-2024 - Swedish Chemicals Agency: Ukraine project design support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kemikalieinspektionen har inkommit med en ans&#xf6;kan om en projektf&#xf6;rberedande insats i Ukraina. Milj&#xf6;ministeriet i Ukraina har efterfr&#xe5;gat svensk st&#xf6;d r&#xf6;rande reformer och EU-anpassning inom milj&#xf6;omr&#xe5;det. Detta projekt syftar till att Kemikalieinspektionen ska unders&#xf6;ka m&#xf6;jligheterna till sammarbete i Ukraina inom sitt kompetensomr&#xe5;de.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Chemicals Agency has submitted a proposal for design support for a possible project in Ukraine. The Ministry of Environmental Protection and Natural Resources of Ukraine has requested support from Sweden on environmental issues. Through this projects the Swedish Chemicals Agency will assess the possibilities for developing a project with support to relevant Ukrainian agencies within the Swedish Chemicals Agency&apos;s area of expertise.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this design project is to assess the conditions and opportunities for the Swedish Chemicals Agency to develop a long-term cooperation with Ukrainian counterparts within the Swedish Chemicals Agency&apos;s areas of competence. 

In addition to the originally agreed objective of the design phase support, the aim during the extension period (April to July 2024) is to provide relevant support to Ukraine for key steps in the EU approximation process.</narrative>
  </description>
